// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — AWL Sublist 7
window.A7_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"adapt – contrary","cards":[{"w":"adapt","p":"v.","d":"to change a book or story into a film or play","c":"改編","s":"The director decided to adapt the novel into a screenplay for the film.","t":"導演決定將小說改編成電影劇本。"},{"w":"adapt to","p":"phr.","d":"to get used to a new situation","c":"適應","s":"It took him a few months to adapt to the new work environment.","t":"他花了幾個月時間適應新的工作環境。"},{"w":"adapted","p":"adj.","d":"changed from a book or story into a film or play","c":"改編的","s":"The adapted version of the play was well-received by the audience.","t":"觀眾對改編版的戲劇反應熱烈。"},{"w":"adaptation","p":"n.","d":"a film or play made from a book or story","c":"改編","s":"The adaptation of the classic novel into a movie was a huge success.","t":"將經典小說改編成電影是一個巨大的成功。"},{"w":"adult","p":"n./adj.","d":"a grown-up person","c":"成年人/成年的","s":"As an adult, it's important to take responsibility for your actions.","t":"作為一個成年人，對自己的行為負責是很重要的。"},{"w":"advocate","p":"v.","d":"to publicly support an idea","c":"提倡","s":"Many health experts advocate for a balanced diet and regular exercise.","t":"許多健康專家提倡均衡飲食和定期運動。"},{"w":"advocate","p":"n.","d":"a person who publicly supports an idea","c":"提倡者","s":"She has been a longtime advocate of renewable energy solutions.","t":"她長期以來一直是可再生能源解決方案的提倡者。"},{"w":"aid","p":"n.","d":"help such as money or food given to people in need","c":"援助","s":"The country provided humanitarian aid to the regions affected by the natural disaster.","t":"該國向受自然災害影響的地區提供了人道援助。"},{"w":"aid","p":"v.","d":"to help someone","c":"援助","s":"The funds will aid in the development of the new community center.","t":"這些資金將援助新社區中心的發展。"},{"w":"channel","p":"n.","d":"a TV station","c":"頻道","s":"The news channel provides updates on current events around the world.","t":"新聞頻道提供了世界各地的最新事件更新。"},{"w":"channel","p":"v.","d":"to direct money or energy toward something","c":"引導","s":"They channel their resources into developing a new product.","t":"他們將資源引導到開發新產品中。"},{"w":"chemical","p":"n.","d":"a substance used in chemistry","c":"化學品","s":"The scientist mixed two chemical together to observe the reaction.","t":"科學家將兩種化學品混合在一起以觀察反應。"},{"w":"classical","p":"adj.","d":"traditional and long-lasting in style","c":"經典的","s":"She enjoys listening to classical music while studying.","t":"她喜歡在學習時聽經典音樂。"},{"w":"comprehend","p":"v.","d":"to understand something","c":"理解","s":"It's difficult to comprehend the complexity of the issue without adequate background knowledge.","t":"如果沒有足夠的背景知識，很難理解這個問題的復雜性。"},{"w":"comprehensive","p":"adj.","d":"including everything; complete","c":"全面的","s":"The report provides a comprehensive overview of the economic situation.","t":"該報告提供了經濟形勢的全面概述。"},{"w":"comprehension","p":"n.","d":"the ability to understand something","c":"理解","s":"His comprehension of the material was evident through his well-thought-out responses.","t":"他對材料的理解通過他經過深思熟慮的回應表現得淋漓盡致。"},{"w":"comprise","p":"v.","d":"to be made up of certain parts","c":"包括","s":"The committee comprise members from various departments.","t":"委員會包括來自各個部門的成員。"},{"w":"be comprised of","p":"phr.","d":"to be made up of certain parts","c":"由...組成","s":"The team is comprised of experts from different fields.","t":"該團隊由來自不同領域的專家組成。"},{"w":"confirm","p":"v.","d":"to say that something is true or certain","c":"確認","s":"Please confirm your attendance by replying to the invitation.","t":"請通過回覆邀請來確認您的出席。"},{"w":"confirmed","p":"adj.","d":"checked and made certain","c":"確認的","s":"The confirmed appointment will take place on Monday at 10 AM.","t":"確認的約會將在星期一上午10點舉行。"},{"w":"confirmation","p":"n.","d":"a message that makes something certain","c":"確認","s":"We are waiting for confirmation from the client before proceeding with the project.","t":"我們正在等待客戶的確認，然後再繼續進行該項目。"},{"w":"contrary","p":"adj.","d":"completely different; opposite","c":"相反的","s":"Her opinion is contrary to mine, yet we work well together.","t":"她的意見與我的相反，但我們合作得很好。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"on the contrary – elimination","cards":[{"w":"on the contrary","p":"phr.","d":"the opposite is true","c":"相反","s":"I thought he would be upset, but on the contrary, he was quite pleased.","t":"我以為他會生氣，但相反，他非常高興。"},{"w":"contrary to","p":"phr.","d":"opposite to; not agreeing with","c":"與...相反","s":"contrary to popular belief, not all spiders are dangerous.","t":"與普遍看法相反，並非所有蜘蛛都是危險的。"},{"w":"convert","p":"v.","d":"to change from one form into another","c":"轉變","s":"They plan to convert the old factory into a modern art gallery.","t":"他們計劃將舊工廠轉變為現代藝術畫廊。"},{"w":"converted","p":"adj.","d":"changed into another form","c":"被轉變的","s":"The converted warehouse now serves as a community center.","t":"被轉變的倉庫現在作為社區中心使用。"},{"w":"conversion","p":"n.","d":"changing something into another form","c":"轉變","s":"The conversion of the building into a school took about a year.","t":"將建築物轉變為學校大約花了一年的時間。"},{"w":"couple","p":"n.","d":"two people who are married or together","c":"夫婦","s":"The couple decided to go for a long drive over the weekend.","t":"這對夫婦決定在周末時出去長途驅車。"},{"w":"a couple of","p":"phr.","d":"two or a few","c":"一些","s":"He brought a couple of friends along to the party.","t":"他帶了一對朋友參加聚會。"},{"w":"decade","p":"n.","d":"a period of ten years","c":"十年","s":"Over the past decade, the city has seen a dramatic increase in population.","t":"在過去的十年中，城市的人口急劇增加。"},{"w":"definite","p":"adj.","d":"certain; sure","c":"明確的","s":"We need a definite answer by the end of the day to proceed with the plans.","t":"我們需要在一天結束時得到明確的答案才能繼續計劃。"},{"w":"indefinite","p":"adj.","d":"with no fixed end","c":"無限的","s":"The project has been put on an indefinite hold due to lack of funding.","t":"由於缺乏資金，該項目已被無限期擱置。"},{"w":"deny","p":"v.","d":"to say that something is not true","c":"否認","s":"The politician had to deny the allegations made against him.","t":"政治人士不得不否認對他提出的指控。"},{"w":"denial","p":"n.","d":"a statement that something is not true","c":"否認","s":"His denial of the accusations didn't convince everyone.","t":"他對指控的否認並未使每個人信服。"},{"w":"differ from","p":"phr.","d":"to be different from something","c":"與...不同","s":"The policies of this administration differ from those of the previous one.","t":"這屆政府的政策與上一屆的政策不同。"},{"w":"differentiate","p":"v.","d":"to see or show the difference between things","c":"區分","s":"It's important to differentiate between facts and opinions.","t":"區分事實和意見非常重要。"},{"w":"differentiation","p":"n.","d":"the act of showing differences","c":"區別","s":"The differentiation of tasks within the team led to a more efficient workflow.","t":"團隊內部的任務區別使工作流程更為高效。"},{"w":"dispose of","p":"phr.","d":"to get rid of something","c":"處理","s":"Please dispose of your trash properly to maintain cleanliness.","t":"請妥善處理您的垃圾以保持清潔。"},{"w":"be disposed to V = tend to V","p":"adj.","d":"to be likely to do something","c":"傾向於","s":"She is disposed to agree with the proposal given its benefits.","t":"鑑於其好處，她傾向於同意該提議。"},{"w":"disposal","p":"n.","d":"throwing something away","c":"處理掉丟棄","s":"The disposal of hazardous waste requires special procedures to ensure safety.","t":"危險廢物的處理需要特殊程序以確保安全。"},{"w":"dynamic","p":"n.","d":"the forces that cause change in a situation","c":"動態","s":"The dynamic of the market changes rapidly, requiring businesses to adapt quickly.","t":"市場的動態變化很快，要求企業迅速適應。"},{"w":"eliminate","p":"v.","d":"to remove something completely","c":"消除，淘汰","s":"They aim to eliminate the barriers preventing access to education.","t":"他們的目標是消除阻止獲取教育的障礙。"},{"w":"eliminated","p":"adj.","d":"removed or taken out of a competition","c":"被消除的被淘汰的","s":"The eliminated risks allowed the project to proceed smoothly.","t":"被消除的風險使項目得以順利進行。"},{"w":"elimination","p":"n.","d":"the act of removing something","c":"消除","s":"The elimination of errors in the data set was crucial for accurate analysis.","t":"數據集中的錯誤消除對於準確分析至關重要。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"empirical – grade","cards":[{"w":"empirical","p":"adj.","d":"based on what you see and test","c":"經驗的","s":"The scientist used an empirical approach to test the hypothesis.","t":"科學家使用經驗方法測試假設。"},{"w":"equip","p":"v.","d":"to give someone the tools they need","c":"裝備","s":"The organization plans to equip the local schools with new computers.","t":"該組織計劃為當地學校裝備新電腦。"},{"w":"be equipped with","p":"phr.","d":"to have the tools or things you need","c":"配備有","s":"The new facility is equipped with modern laboratories and state-of-the-art technology.","t":"新設施配備有現代實驗室和最先進的技術。"},{"w":"well-equipped","p":"adj.","d":"having all the right tools","c":"裝備良好的","s":"The well-equipped gym has everything needed for a complete workout.","t":"裝備良好的健身房擁有完成全部運動所需的一切。"},{"w":"equipment","p":"n.","d":"tools or machines used for a job","c":"設備","s":"Proper maintenance of equipment is essential for ensuring long-term functionality.","t":"正確維護設備對於確保長期功能至關重要。"},{"w":"extract","p":"n.","d":"a substance taken from a plant or food","c":"提取物","s":"The vanilla extract added a wonderful aroma to the baked goods.","t":"香草提取物為烘焙食品增添了美妙的香氣。"},{"w":"extract","p":"v.","d":"to take something out","c":"提取","s":"They managed to extract valuable information from the old documents.","t":"他們設法從舊文件中提取有價值的信息。"},{"w":"extracted","p":"adj.","d":"taken out of something","c":"提取的","s":"The extracted data was analyzed to identify patterns.","t":"提取的數據被分析以識別模式。"},{"w":"file","p":"n.","d":"a collection of information on a computer","c":"文件","s":"Please save the document as a PDF file before emailing it.","t":"請在通過電子郵件發送之前將文檔另存為PDF文件。"},{"w":"file","p":"v.","d":"to officially send a document","c":"提交","s":"She will file the report by the end of the day.","t":"她將在一天結束時提交報告。"},{"w":"finite","p":"adj.","d":"having an end or limit","c":"有限的","s":"Resources are finite, so we need to use them wisely.","t":"資源是有限的，所以我們需要明智地使用它們。"},{"w":"infinite","p":"adj.","d":"without end or limit","c":"無限的","s":"The universe is vast and seemingly infinite.","t":"宇宙是廣大且看似無限的。"},{"w":"infinity","p":"n.","d":"something without end","c":"無限","s":"The concept of infinity is difficult to fully grasp.","t":"無限的概念很難完全理解。"},{"w":"found","p":"v.","d":"to start a company or organization","c":"創立","s":"They plan to found a non-profit organization to support education in underprivileged areas.","t":"他們計劃創立一個非盈利組織以支持貧困地區的教育。"},{"w":"be founded","p":"phr.","d":"to be started or created","c":"被創立","s":"The charity was founded in 2005 with the mission of alleviating poverty.","t":"該慈善機構於2005年成立，旨在減輕貧困。"},{"w":"founder","p":"n.","d":"a person who starts a company","c":"創始人","s":"The founder of the company is known for his innovative ideas and charismatic leadership.","t":"公司的創始人以其創新思想和富有感召力的領導而著稱。"},{"w":"foundation","p":"n.","d":"the basic part that supports something","c":"基礎","s":"A strong foundation in mathematics is essential for pursuing a degree in engineering.","t":"在數學上有堅實的基礎對於攻讀工程學位至關重要。"},{"w":"foundation","p":"n.","d":"an organization that gives money to help others","c":"基金會","s":"The foundation aims to promote educational initiatives in developing countries.","t":"該基金會旨在促進發展中國家的教育倡議。"},{"w":"globe","p":"n.","d":"the earth","c":"地球","s":"Climate change is a pressing issue facing the globe.","t":"氣候變化是地球面臨的一個迫切問題。"},{"w":"global","p":"adj.","d":"about the whole world","c":"全球的","s":"The pandemic has had a global impact on economies worldwide.","t":"大流行病對全球經濟產生了全球性影響。"},{"w":"globally","p":"adv.","d":"around the whole world","c":"全球地","s":"The company is expanding globally to reach new markets.","t":"公司正在全球範圍內擴展以開拓新市場。"},{"w":"grade","p":"v.","d":"to give a mark to schoolwork","c":"給...打分","s":"The teacher took a long time to grade the final exams due to the large number of students.","t":"由於學生人數眾多，老師花了很長時間給期末考試打分。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"grade – isolated","cards":[{"w":"grade","p":"n.","d":"a level of quality or difficulty","c":"等級","s":"The grade of difficulty for this video game increases as you progress through the levels.","t":"隨著你在關卡中的進步，這款視頻遊戲的難度等級會增加。"},{"w":"grade","p":"n.","d":"a mark for schoolwork","c":"成績","s":"He was happy with his grade on the midterm exam.","t":"他對期中考試的成績感到滿意。"},{"w":"guarantee","p":"v.","d":"to promise something","c":"保證","s":"We guarantee satisfaction or your money back.","t":"我們保證滿意，否則退款。"},{"w":"guarantee","p":"n.","d":"a written promise to repair a product","c":"保證","s":"The product comes with a one-year guarantee for repairs.","t":"產品附帶一年的維修保證。"},{"w":"guaranteed","p":"adj.","d":"certain to happen","c":"保證的","s":"With the team's strong lineup, victory was almost guaranteed.","t":"有了團隊的強大陣容，勝利幾乎是保證的。"},{"w":"hierarchical","p":"adj.","d":"arranged by rank or level","c":"分層的","s":"The company has a hierarchical structure with clear lines of authority.","t":"公司具有分層結構，權限劃分清晰。"},{"w":"hierarchy","p":"n.","d":"a system of levels from high to low","c":"等級制度","s":"Understanding the hierarchy within the organization is crucial for effective communication.","t":"瞭解組織內的等級制度對於有效溝通至關重要。"},{"w":"identical to","p":"phr.","d":"exactly the same as","c":"與...相同","s":"The results of the experiment were nearly identical to those of the previous study.","t":"實驗的結果與先前研究的結果幾乎相同。"},{"w":"ideology","p":"n.","d":"a set of political beliefs","c":"意識形態","s":"Different political ideology often lead to heated debates.","t":"不同的政治意識形態經常導致激烈的辯論。"},{"w":"infer","p":"v.","d":"to guess something from what you know","c":"推斷","s":"From the evidence provided, we can infer that the suspect had a motive.","t":"從提供的證據中，我們可以推斷嫌疑人有動機。"},{"w":"inferred","p":"adj.","d":"guessed from what you know","c":"推斷的","s":"The inferred conclusions from the data should be taken with caution.","t":"應謹慎對待從數據中推斷出的結論。"},{"w":"innovate","p":"v.","d":"to make new ideas or ways of doing things","c":"創新","s":"Companies that fail to innovate risk falling behind in the competitive market.","t":"未能創新的公司有在競爭市場中落後的風險。"},{"w":"innovative","p":"adj.","d":"using new ideas","c":"創新的","s":"Their innovative approach to teaching engages students in active learning.","t":"他們創新的教學方法讓學生參與積極學習。"},{"w":"innovation","p":"n.","d":"a new idea or way of doing things","c":"創新","s":"The tech industry is driven by constant innovation and development.","t":"科技行業受到不斷創新和發展的推動。"},{"w":"insert","p":"v.","d":"to put something into something else","c":"插入","s":"Please insert your credit card into the machine to complete the transaction.","t":"請將您的信用卡插入機器以完成交易。"},{"w":"inserted","p":"adj.","d":"put into something else","c":"已插入的","s":"The inserted chip improved the device's performance significantly.","t":"已插入的芯片顯著提高了設備的性能。"},{"w":"insertion","p":"n.","d":"the act of putting something into something","c":"插入","s":"The insertion of the new data skewed the results of the analysis.","t":"新數據的插入使分析結果產生偏差。"},{"w":"intervene","p":"v.","d":"to step in to help or stop something","c":"介入","s":"The government decided to intervene in the market to stabilize prices.","t":"政府決定介入市場以穩定價格。"},{"w":"intervened","p":"adj.","d":"done to help or stop a problem","c":"介入的","s":"The intervened measures helped prevent a larger crisis.","t":"介入的措施有助於防止更大的危機。"},{"w":"intervention","p":"n.","d":"the act of stepping in to help","c":"介入","s":"Early intervention is crucial in managing the disease effectively.","t":"早期介入對於有效管理疾病至關重要。"},{"w":"isolate","p":"v.","d":"to keep someone or something apart","c":"隔離","s":"The researchers aim to isolate the cause of the problem.","t":"研究人員的目標是隔離問題的原因。"},{"w":"isolated","p":"adj.","d":"alone; far from others","c":"隔離的","s":"The isolated community had its own unique traditions and customs.","t":"隔離的社區有自己獨特的傳統和習俗。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"isolation – release pressure","cards":[{"w":"isolation","p":"n.","d":"being alone or apart","c":"隔離","s":"The isolation of the virus was a critical step in developing a vaccine.","t":"病毒的隔離是開發疫苗的關鍵步驟。"},{"w":"medium","p":"n.","d":"a way of sending information","c":"媒介","s":"The artist chose a unique medium for his sculpture, utilizing recycled materials.","t":"藝術家為他的雕塑選擇了獨特的媒介，利用了回收材料。"},{"w":"media","p":"n.","d":"TV, radio, newspapers and the internet","c":"媒體","s":"The media plays a crucial role in shaping public opinion.","t":"媒體在塑造公眾意見中起著至關重要的作用。"},{"w":"mode","p":"n.","d":"a way of doing something","c":"模式","s":"Switching the application to dark mode helps reduce eye strain.","t":"將應用程序切換到深色模式有助於減輕眼睛疲勞。"},{"w":"paradigm","p":"n.","d":"a model or example of how to think","c":"範例","s":"The scientist challenged the existing paradigm with her groundbreaking research.","t":"科學家通過她的開創性研究挑戰了現有的範例。"},{"w":"phenomenon","p":"n.","d":"something that happens and can be seen","c":"現象","s":"The migration of monarch butterflies is a fascinating natural phenomenon.","t":"帝王蝶的遷徙是一個迷人的自然現象。"},{"w":"prior to","p":"phr.","d":"before","c":"在...之前","s":"You should complete all required training prior to starting the job.","t":"在開始工作之前，您應完成所有必需的培訓。"},{"w":"priority","p":"n.","d":"something more important than other things","c":"優先權","s":"Health and safety are of the highest priority in this facility.","t":"健康和安全是這個設施的最高優先事項。"},{"w":"prioritize","p":"v.","d":"to decide what is most important","c":"給...擺列優先順序","s":"It's important to prioritize tasks based on their urgency and importance.","t":"根據任務的緊急性和重要性給它們擺列優先順序非常重要。"},{"w":"prohibit","p":"v.","d":"to officially not allow something","c":"禁止","s":"The law prohibit smoking in public places to protect the health of non-smokers.","t":"法律禁止在公共場所吸煙以保護非吸煙者的健康。"},{"w":"prohibited","p":"adj.","d":"not allowed by law or rule","c":"被禁止的","s":"The possession of prohibited substances can lead to severe legal consequences.","t":"擁有被禁止的物質可能導致嚴重的法律後果。"},{"w":"prohibition","p":"n.","d":"a law that stops something","c":"禁令","s":"The prohibition on alcohol during the 1920s led to the rise of speakeasies.","t":"20世紀20年代對酒精的禁令導致了私酒店的興起。"},{"w":"publish","p":"v.","d":"to print and sell a book or magazine","c":"出版","s":"She managed to publish her first book at the age of twenty.","t":"她在二十歲時成功出版了她的第一本書。"},{"w":"published","p":"adj.","d":"printed and made public","c":"出版的","s":"The published works of the author have been translated into multiple languages.","t":"作者的出版物已被翻譯成多種語言。"},{"w":"publisher","p":"n.","d":"a company that publishes books","c":"出版商","s":"The publisher decided to print a second edition due to high demand.","t":"由於需求很高，出版商決定印刷第二版。"},{"w":"publication","p":"n.","d":"a book or magazine that is published","c":"出版物","s":"The publication received positive reviews from the critics.","t":"出版物得到了評論家的好評。"},{"w":"quote","p":"v.","d":"to repeat someone's exact words","c":"引用","s":"It's crucial to quote reputable sources in your research paper.","t":"在你的研究論文中引用可靠的來源非常重要。"},{"w":"quote","p":"n.","d":"someone's exact words repeated","c":"引文","s":"He started his speech with a quote from Nelson Mandela.","t":"他以納爾遜·曼德拉的引文開始了他的演講。"},{"w":"quotation","p":"n.","d":"someone's exact words repeated","c":"引文","s":"The quotation was taken from a speech by Martin Luther King Jr.","t":"引文摘自馬丁·路德·金（Martin Luther King Jr.）的演講。"},{"w":"quotation","p":"n.","d":"a price given for work","c":"報價","s":"Please provide a quotation for the services you will be providing.","t":"請為您將提供的服務提供報價。"},{"w":"release a hostage","p":"v.","d":"to set someone free","c":"釋放人質","s":"The kidnappers agreed to release a hostage after the ransom was paid.","t":"綁架者在贖金支付後同意釋放人質。"},{"w":"release pressure","p":"phr.","d":"to let out pressure","c":"釋放壓力","s":"Regular exercise is a good way to release pressure and manage stress.","t":"定期運動是釋放壓力並控制壓力的好方法。"}]},{"unit":6,"theme":"release a song /album – survive","cards":[{"w":"release a song /album","p":"phr.","d":"to make a song or album available","c":"發行歌曲/專輯","s":"The band is excited to release a song next month after a year of recording and production.","t":"樂隊很高興能在經過一年的錄音和製作後在下個月發行歌曲/專輯。"},{"w":"released","p":"adj.","d":"made available to the public","c":"已發行的","s":"The released album received critical acclaim and topped the charts.","t":"已發行的專輯受到了好評並登上了排行榜。"},{"w":"release","p":"n.","d":"the act of making something available","c":"發行","s":"The release of the software update was delayed due to some unexpected bugs.","t":"由於一些意外的錯誤，軟件更新的發行被延遲了。"},{"w":"reverse","p":"n.","d":"going backward","c":"反轉","s":"Driving in reverse requires careful attention to avoid accidents.","t":"倒車時需要仔細注意以避免事故。"},{"w":"reverse","p":"v.","d":"to change something to the opposite","c":"反轉","s":"It's difficult to reverse the effects of pollution on the environment.","t":"很難扭轉污染對環境的影響。"},{"w":"reversible","p":"adj.","d":"able to be changed back","c":"可逆的","s":"The damage to the ecosystem is not reversible without immediate action.","t":"如果不立即採取行動，生態系統的損害是不可逆的。"},{"w":"irreversible","p":"adj.","d":"not able to be changed back","c":"不可逆的","s":"The decision could have irreversible consequences, so it should be considered carefully.","t":"這個決定可能會有不可逆的後果，所以應該仔細考慮。"},{"w":"simulate","p":"v.","d":"to copy how something real works","c":"模擬","s":"Engineers simulate different scenarios to test the resilience of the structure.","t":"工程師模擬不同的情境以測試結構的恢復力。"},{"w":"simulated","p":"adj.","d":"made to look like the real thing","c":"模擬的","s":"The simulated environment helps researchers study behavior in controlled settings.","t":"模擬環境幫助研究人員在受控設置中研究行為。"},{"w":"simulation","p":"n.","d":"a model or copy of a real situation","c":"模擬","s":"The simulation allowed the team to predict potential outcomes before making a decision.","t":"模擬使團隊能夠在做出決定之前預測可能的結果。"},{"w":"sole","p":"adj.","d":"only; the only one","c":"唯一的","s":"She is the sole heir to the family fortune.","t":"她是家族財富的唯一繼承人。"},{"w":"solely","p":"adv.","d":"only","c":"唯一地","s":"The decision was based solely on the evidence presented.","t":"這個決定完全基於提供的證據。"},{"w":"somewhat","p":"adv.","d":"a little; to some degree","c":"有些","s":"The results were somewhat surprising given the lack of preparation.","t":"鑑於缺乏準備，結果有些令人驚訝。"},{"w":"submit","p":"v.","d":"to give something in for a decision","c":"提交","s":"Please submit your application by the deadline to be considered.","t":"請在截止日期前提交您的申請以供考慮。"},{"w":"submitted","p":"adj.","d":"given in for a decision","c":"已提交的","s":"The submitted documents are under review by the committee.","t":"委員會正在審查已提交的文件。"},{"w":"submission","p":"n.","d":"the act of giving something in","c":"提交","s":"The deadline for submission of proposals is next Friday.","t":"提案提交的截止日期是下周五。"},{"w":"success","p":"n.","d":"getting what you want","c":"成功","s":"Hard work and determination are key factors for success.","t":"努力和決心是成功的關鍵因素。"},{"w":"succeed","p":"v.","d":"to do what you tried to do","c":"成功","s":"With enough effort, you can succeed in achieving your goals.","t":"通過足夠的努力，您可以在實現目標方面取得成功。"},{"w":"succeed","p":"v.","d":"to take over a job after someone","c":"繼承","s":"She will succeed her father as the CEO of the company.","t":"她將繼承她父親成為公司的首席執行官。"},{"w":"successive","p":"adj.","d":"following one after another","c":"連續的","s":"The team secured successive victories in the tournament.","t":"該隊在比賽中獲得了連續的勝利。"},{"w":"successful","p":"adj.","d":"having good results","c":"成功的","s":"The successful entrepreneur shared his journey and experiences in a recent interview.","t":"成功的企業家最近在一次訪談中分享了他的旅程和經歷。"},{"w":"survive","p":"v.","d":"to stay alive","c":"生存","s":"It's remarkable how some plants can survive in extremely harsh climates.","t":"有些植物能在極其惡劣的氣候中生存，這真是令人驚奇。"}]},{"unit":7,"theme":"survival – volunteer","cards":[{"w":"survival","p":"n.","d":"staying alive","c":"生存","s":"The survival of the fittest is a concept derived from evolutionary theory.","t":"適者生存是從進化理論中得出的概念。"},{"w":"survivor","p":"n.","d":"a person who stays alive after danger","c":"生還者","s":"The survivor of the accident were rescued and provided medical attention.","t":"事故的生還者得到了救援並得到了醫療照顧。"},{"w":"thesis","p":"n.","d":"a long piece of writing for a university degree","c":"論文","s":"She is currently working on her thesis which explores the impacts of social media.","t":"她目前正在研究她的論文，探討社交媒體的影響。"},{"w":"topic","p":"n.","d":"a subject people talk or write about","c":"主題","s":"The topic of discussion for today's meeting is improving team collaboration.","t":"今天會議的討論主題是提高團隊協作。"},{"w":"transmit","p":"v.","d":"to send signals or messages","c":"傳送","s":"The radio tower is used to transmit signals across long distances.","t":"廣播塔用於跨長距離傳送信號。"},{"w":"transmitted","p":"adj.","d":"sent or passed on","c":"傳送的","s":"The transmitted data enabled researchers to analyze the situation remotely.","t":"傳送的數據使研究人員能夠遠程分析情況。"},{"w":"transmission","p":"n.","d":"the act of sending signals or messages","c":"傳送","s":"The transmission of cultural values occurs through various societal institutions.","t":"文化價值的傳送通過各種社會機構進行。"},{"w":"ultimate","p":"adj.","d":"final; most important","c":"最終的","s":"The ultimate goal is to achieve a sustainable and inclusive economy.","t":"最終目標是實現可持續和包容的經濟。"},{"w":"ultimately","p":"adv.","d":"in the end","c":"最終","s":"ultimately, the decision rests with the board of directors.","t":"最終，決定由董事會做出。"},{"w":"unique","p":"adj.","d":"very special; the only one of its kind","c":"獨特的","s":"Each person has a unique set of experiences that shape their perspective.","t":"每個人都有一套獨特的經歷，塑造了他們的觀點。"},{"w":"visible","p":"adj.","d":"able to be seen","c":"可見的","s":"The stars are not visible during the day due to the brightness of the sun.","t":"由於太陽的光亮，白天看不見星星。"},{"w":"invisible","p":"adj.","d":"not able to be seen","c":"看不見的","s":"There are many invisible factors that can influence a situation.","t":"有許多看不見的因素可能會影響一個情況。"},{"w":"visibility","p":"n.","d":"how well you can see","c":"可見度","s":"The fog reduced visibility on the road, making driving hazardous.","t":"霧減少了道路上的能見度，使駕駛變得危險。"},{"w":"voluntary","p":"adj.","d":"done because you want to, not for money","c":"自願的","s":"She took a voluntary leave of absence to care for her family.","t":"她自願請假照顧家人。"},{"w":"volunteer","p":"v.","d":"to offer to do something without being paid","c":"自願","s":"Many people volunteer their time and skills to help community projects.","t":"許多人自願花時間和技能幫助社區項目。"},{"w":"volunteer","p":"n.","d":"a person who works without being paid","c":"志願者","s":"The event was successful thanks to the hard work of volunteer.","t":"由於志願者的努力，活動取得了成功。"}]}];
